{{Documentation/Header}}
This template displays a list of the most recent user blog posts from across all user blogs on the wiki.

==Syntax==
{{T|LatestUserBlogs|v1=|v2=|v3=}}

==Examples==
{{T|LatestUserBlogs|count=10|_Y_=1}}

== Pinned posts ==
Posts listed in [[Template:MP-Blog/pin.json]] are always shown at the top, in the order they appear in the JSON array (first entry = topmost pin). Pinned posts get a thumbtack icon and are excluded from the latest-posts list below them so they never appear twice.

== Filtering ==
Only wikitext blog posts are listed: pages whose titles end in <code>.json</code>, <code>.css</code> or <code>.js</code> (JSON/CSS/JavaScript content models) are excluded.

=== Dependencies ===
* DPL3 extension
* [[Template:LatestUserBlogItem]] (helper template)
* [[Module:BlogCard]] (card rendering + pinned-post handling)
* [[Template:MP-Blog/pin.json]] (pinned posts, ordered)


